{"resourceIdentifier":"2957","resourceName":"Wuhan Chenjiachong Landfill Gas Power Generation Project Phase II","description":"Wuhan Chenjiachong Landfill Gas Power Generation Project Phase II (hereafter referred to as “the Project”) is a landfill gas (LFG) recovery and utilization project located at Chenjiachong Landfill Phase II, Chenjiachong Town, Yangluo County, Xinzhou District, Wuhan City, Hubei province, People’s Republic of China. \r\nThe purpose of the Project is to collect LFG from Chenjiachong Landfill Phase II and utilize it for power generation. The Project started construction in December 2019. Four power generators of 1.095 MW each, which add up to 4.38 MW, have been installed, and they were put into operation on 14-July-2020.\r\nThe Project achieves emission reductions in two aspects: 1) it avoids methane emissions by capturing and destroying LFG which would have been directly vented into the atmosphere in the baseline scenario; 2) it reduces CO2 emissions by displacing part of the electricity that would otherwise have been supplied by CCPG.","location":{"latitude":30.735555,"longitude":114.544166},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-04-28","endExclusive":"2022-05-29","endInclusive":"2022-05-28"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2957"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Wuhan Jianghuan OneCarbon Energy Development Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2957"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"167482"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCO